  "description": "Data-source-neutral market-data primitives for futures backtesting and live trading with one shared code path: the SDBAL canonical event model (Trade/Quote/Depth/Snapshot) and .sdbal binary format — a compact, seekable container for L1+L2 event streams with keyframed blocks and per-block CRC-32C — plus an L1+L2 order book with market-sweep and limit-queue fill primitives, Renko/interval bar builders, Symbol/Instrument/Contract identities, and a holiday-aware trade-date calendar. An idiosyncratic tool supporting SquidEyes' own work; shared as an educational project.",
